cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Oskilo'yu çalışmanızda kullandıysanız lütfen kaynak gösterin. / If you use Oskilo in your work, please cite it."
type: software
title: "Oskilo: lossless serial and network data logger for STM32, Arduino and ESP32"
abstract: >-
  Desktop application that records data from microcontroller boards over a serial port or the
  local network (TCP/UDP) without losing samples, with sequence-number and CRC checks, live charts,
  FFT, alarms and Excel/CSV export.
authors:
